Here’s the facility inventory published in Crypto.com Arena’s official A–Z Guide, Accessibility Guide, and parking pages, organized around the categories you requested. The arena uses named pedestrian entrances—not “Gate 1,” “Gate 2,” etc. Lettered gates such as Gate B refer to parking-garage entrances.

One limitation: the guides do not individually name or locate every restroom, elevator, or AED. Below, I list every individually identified facility in your requested categories and explicitly distinguish confirmed accessibility from details the arena does not publish.

