Important gaps to preserve in your list
For a directory or dataset, the key distinction is between “confirmed accessible,” “accessibility accommodation provided,” and “not specified”—rather than assigning every facility a simple yes/no value.

The material source issues are:

Upper Guest Services has an unresolved U5/U6 discrepancy between official guides.

Only the five All Gender restrooms are individually located; the other restrooms are collectively confirmed wheelchair accessible.

Parking Gates E & F are published together, not as separately described facilities.

Entrance-by-entrance step-free details, individual elevator and AED locations, and most room-level accessibility measurements are not supplied.

For verification of those gaps, the arena lists Guest Services at 213-742-7326, in-event text assistance at 213-616-9950, and Parking Services at 213-765-6815.

